      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">C → 3 → 27 − 3 = 24<br />\nA → 1 → 27 − 1 = 26<br />\nT → 20 → 27 − 20 = 7</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, CAT → 24, 26, 7</p>\n",
