      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Logic: The operation “#” is defined as </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"># = (first number × second number) + second number</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Apply to 7 # 5 → 7 × 5 + 5 = 35 + 5 = 40</span></p>\n",
